{"turns": [
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thank you for calling Nimbus Telecom. My name is Ravi. How can I help you today?",
    "tags": ["greeting"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Hi Ravi, I'm calling because my internet connection has been dropping constantly for the last three days. It's incredibly frustrating.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I am sorry to hear that you are experiencing these connectivity issues. I can certainly look into this for you.",
    "tags": ["empathy"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "I just want this fixed or I'm leaving.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I understand. Before we dive into the account details, could you please provide your account number and full name?",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "My name is Sneha Nair and my account number is 24040355.",
    "tags": ["identity_verification"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thank you, Ms. Nair. I'm checking the network status in your area. It seems there is some instability in the local exchange, but I cannot see any specific outage reported yet.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Instability? I can't work from home. This is unacceptable. I'm thinking about switching to another provider who actually provides a stable connection.",
    "tags": ["churn_signal"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I would hate to see you go. Let me try to reset the connection from my end, but I'm not sure if that will solve the root cause.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "I've already tried restarting the router three times. I'm tired of this. Just cancel my service entirely.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I can start the cancellation process for you, but I'll need to verify your email address on file to proceed.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "It's sneha.78@examplemail.com and my phone number is 97228 17163.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thank you. I have noted your request to cancel the account. I will pass this to the retention team for processing.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "This is a joke. You haven't fixed the network and now you're just passing me to another team. I am absolutely disgusted with this service!",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I apologize for the frustration. Is there anything else I can assist you with today? I've noted the cancellation request and the network issue. Goodbye.",
    "tags": ["closure"]
  }
]}
